+# Performance history
+
+## SessionStart health gate
+
+Measured p50 for the complete `SessionStart` health gate on a 5,000-record
+store:
+
+| Revision | p50 |
+| --- | ---: |
+| Before `PRAGMA quick_check` was removed from the read path | 11.9 ms |
+| After `quick_check` was moved off the read path | 1.05 ms |
+
+The after measurement is for the bundled revision that also added the
+trigger-maintained `fts_rows` counter and the `body` `CHECK` constraint. Because
+those changes landed together, this before/after measurement does not isolate
+their individual effects.
